{"seq":2,"slug":"courier-app-tracking-eta","title":"司机 App 轨迹与 ETA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/elastic-capacity-schedule/courier-app-tracking-eta","wordCount":1913,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"司机-app-轨迹与-eta\">司机 App 轨迹与 ETA</h1><p>买家看到的那句&quot;骑手还有 8 分钟到达&quot;，背后是一次跨越移动端、通信层、地理索引与时间预估的完整链路。这句话的准确性直接决定三件事：买家愿不愿意下楼、骑手会不会因为&quot;到了没人接&quot;而白等、以及系统敢不敢把 <a href=\"../real-time-dispatch-bid/along-route-batching\">顺路派送与订单聚合</a> 的路线规划得更激进。ETA 偏了，下游全部跟着偏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-轨迹采集的三个约束\">核心概念：轨迹采集的三个约束</h2><p>移动端位置上报看起来简单——定时上报坐标即可——但三个约束会把最朴素的设计撕碎。</p>\n<h3 id=\"精度-频率与电量的三方博弈\">精度、频率与电量的三方博弈</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定位模式</th>\n<th>典型精度</th>\n<th>典型功耗</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GPS 高精度</td>\n<td>5–20 m</td>\n<td>高（每小时数个百分点电）</td>\n<td>派单中、接近送达点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络定位（基站/WiFi）</td>\n<td>50–500 m</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>在线待接单、低频心跳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被动定位（系统聚合）</td>\n<td>100 m–数 km</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>离线时的粗略位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>司机端 App 最容易被用户卸载的理由是&quot;耗电&quot;。因此上报策略必须是<strong>自适应的</strong>：在派单中（有进行中的订单）用高频高精度，在线待接单用低频中精度，离线时停止主动定位。这个状态机与运力状态（见 <a href=\"../crowd-courier-onboard/courier-tier-capacity-zone\">运力分层与服务区域</a>）耦合——只有 <code>active</code> 且&quot;有进行中订单&quot;的状态才值得付高功耗。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[App 生命周期] --&gt; B{有进行中订单?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[GPS 高频&lt;br/&gt;5-15 s 一次]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{司机已上线?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[网络定位&lt;br/&gt;30-60 s 一次]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[停止主动定位&lt;br/&gt;仅被动上报]&#10;  C --&gt; G[本地缓冲队列]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|批量上报| H[服务端接入]&#10;  H --&gt; I{网络可用?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[指数退避重试&lt;br/&gt;保留最近 N 条]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[写入位置流]\">graph TD\n  A[App 生命周期] --&gt; B{有进行中订单?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[GPS 高频&lt;br/&gt;5-15 s 一次]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{司机已上线?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[网络定位&lt;br/&gt;30-60 s 一次]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[停止主动定位&lt;br/&gt;仅被动上报]\n  C --&gt; G[本地缓冲队列]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|批量上报| H[服务端接入]\n  H --&gt; I{网络可用?}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[指数退避重试&lt;br/&gt;保留最近 N 条]\n  I --&gt;|是| K[写入位置流]</pre><h3 id=\"断网与弱网\">断网与弱网</h3><p>骑手会进地库、会进电梯、会经过信号盲区，这是常态而非异常。因此客户端必须有<strong>本地缓冲与批量上报</strong>：把位置点缓存在本地队列，恢复网络后批量提交，服务端按时间戳排序后消费。</p>\n<p>这个设计带来两个后果需要处理：<strong>一是位置点的时间戳是客户端时间，不可全信</strong>（设备时钟可能被改），服务端应记录接收时间并标记两者的偏差；<strong>二是批量上报会让位置流出现&quot;时间回填&quot;</strong>，即服务端先收到 T+60 的点再收到 T+30 的点，因此下游消费者（ETA 模型、轨迹回放）必须按事件时间而非到达时间排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从坐标到格子-地理索引的选择\">从坐标到格子：地理索引的选择</h2><h3 id=\"h3-与-geohash-的取舍\">H3 与 geohash 的取舍</h3><p>位置数据写入后，第一步是落到地理格子上，以便派单查询。可选方案是多边形判断、geohash、H3。</p>\n<p>H3 是六边形分层索引，全球 16 级分辨率，例如分辨率 9 平均面积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.105</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.105\\ \\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.105</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、边长约 0.2 km，分辨率 8 约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.74</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.74\\ \\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.74</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://h3geo.org/docs/core-library/restable/\">H3 Resolution Table</a>）。它相对 geohash 的关键优势是<strong>邻域距离一致性</strong>：六边形的所有邻居到中心距离相等，而 geohash 的矩形格子在对角方向与边方向的邻居距离差约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍。对&quot;查询半径内所有司机&quot;这类操作，H3 的均匀性让半径查询更接近圆形，不需要额外补偿。</p>\n<p>Redis 提供内建的 geospatial 命令集（<code>GEOADD</code>/<code>GEOSEARCH</code>/<code>GEODIST</code>），底层用有序集合存储 52 位 geohash 编码，<code>GEOSEARCH</code> 的复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N + \\log M)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/develop/data-types/geospatial/\">Redis Geospatial</a>）。对于中小规模（在线司机数在万级以内）的网络，直接用 Redis 的 <code>GEOSEARCH</code> 做半径查询是性价比最高的方案；规模继续增大时再考虑自建 H3 索引与分片。</p>\n<h3 id=\"位置写入的幂等与去重\">位置写入的幂等与去重</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE courier_position (&#10;  identity_id  BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  recorded_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,     -- 客户端时间戳&#10;  received_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  lat          DOUBLE PRECISION NOT NULL,&#10;  lon          DOUBLE PRECISION NOT NULL,&#10;  h3_cell      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  accuracy_m   SMALLINT,&#10;  speed_mps    REAL,&#10;  heading_deg  SMALLINT,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (identity_id, recorded_at)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> courier_position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  identity_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recorded_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 客户端时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  received_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lat          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DOUBLE PRECISION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lon          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DOUBLE PRECISION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  h3_cell      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  accuracy_m   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  speed_mps    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  heading_deg  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (identity_id, recorded_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>主键用 <code>(identity_id, recorded_at)</code> 让重复上报天然幂等——网络重试导致的重复点会被主键冲突吸收。<code>speed_mps</code> 与 <code>heading_deg</code> 不是冗余字段：它们让 ETA 模型可以直接使用设备融合后的速度与朝向，而不必从稀疏的坐标点差分估计（差分估计在低频采样下误差很大）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eta-估计-从直线距离到可信时间\">ETA 估计：从直线距离到可信时间</h2><h3 id=\"朴素估计及其失效场景\">朴素估计及其失效场景</h3><p>最朴素的 ETA 是直线距离除以平均速度。它在两种场景下失效最严重：<strong>跨河与跨铁路</strong>（直线 500 米，实际绕行 3 公里）与<strong>高峰拥堵</strong>（同样的路，平峰 8 分钟，高峰 22 分钟）。</p>\n<p>改进的第一个层次是引入<strong>路网距离</strong>而不是直线距离。开源路由引擎可以提供这个能力：OSRM 暴露 <code>route</code>（给定顺序的最快路线）、<code>table</code>（全对全时间距离矩阵）、<code>nearest</code>（坐标吸附到路网）与 <code>match</code>（GPS 轨迹吸附）等服务，其中 <code>match</code> 会返回 0–1 之间的置信度，并会在时间戳间隔超过 60 秒处切分轨迹（<a href=\"https://project-osrm.org/docs/v5.24.0/api/\">OSRM API</a>）。<code>table</code> 服务对派单尤其有用——一次请求拿到多个候选司机到取件点的时间矩阵，比逐个调用 <code>route</code> 便宜得多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分位数的-eta-而非期望值\">分位数的 ETA 而非期望值</h3><p>给用户的承诺应该是<strong>分位数</strong>而不是均值。若预计送达时间的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，对时效敏感的场景应展示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>75</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{75}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>90</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{90}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因为虚报（承诺 8 分钟实际 20 分钟）造成的伤害远大于保守（承诺 15 分钟实际 12 分钟）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ETA_{user} = \\hat{t}_{route} \\cdot \\phi_{traffic}(t, edge) + t_{stop}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0285em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_{traffic}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是路段级的拥堵系数（按时段与路段标定），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{stop}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是停靠与交接时间（上下楼、找门牌、等买家），这一项在住宅区常常占总时长的三分之一以上，不可忽略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误差监控\">误差监控</h3><p>ETA 模型必须有持续的误差监控，否则会静默劣化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MAPE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MAPE} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum \\left| \\frac{\\hat{t}_i - t_i}{t_i} \\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAPE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5055em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5555em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>按市场、时段、订单类型分别计算 MAPE 并看趋势，比看全局均值更能发现问题——典型情况是全局 MAPE 稳定但某城市晚高峰 MAPE 从 18% 涨到 35%，原因是该城市新开了一条快速路导致路网数据过期。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;eta_model&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;market&quot;: &quot;SG&quot;,&#10;    &quot;router&quot;: &quot;osrm&quot;,&#10;    &quot;traffic_factor_source&quot;: &quot;segment_speed_history&quot;,&#10;    &quot;stop_time_model&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;residential_high_rise&quot;: 240,&#10;      &quot;residential_landed&quot;: 90,&#10;      &quot;office_tower&quot;: 300,&#10;      &quot;default&quot;: 150&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;display_quantile&quot;: 0.75,&#10;    &quot;monitor&quot;: { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;mape&quot;, &quot;segment_by&quot;: [&quot;hour_bucket&quot;, &quot;order_type&quot;], &quot;alert_threshold&quot;: 0.3 }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eta_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SG\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"router\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"osrm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"traffic_factor_source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"segment_speed_history\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stop_time_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"residential_high_rise\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">240</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"residential_landed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"office_tower\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"display_quantile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"monitor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mape\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"segment_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hour_bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alert_threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>stop_time_model</code> 按建筑类型给出停靠时间的先验，比全局常数准确得多。<code>display_quantile: 0.75</code> 是前面说的保守展示策略的可配置落点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私边界\">隐私边界</h2><p>位置轨迹是<strong>高敏感个人数据</strong>：它能推断出司机的居住地、作息、宗教活动场所。因此设计时必须遵守几条硬约束：轨迹只用于配送履约与安全（事故溯源），不用于绩效监控之外的任何目的；对司机本人提供可查看的位置数据留存说明；留存期限明确（多数市场建议 30–90 天）。欧盟的平台工作指令明确禁止处理&quot;非工作时间活动&quot;的数据（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=OJ:L_202402831\">Directive (EU) 2024/2831</a>），这意味着 App 在司机下线后必须真正停止定位采集，而不是&quot;降频继续采&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>位置上报是精度、频率、电量的三方博弈，必须按&quot;是否有进行中订单&quot;自适应切换定位模式，离线时真正停止主动定位。</li>\n<li>弱网是常态，客户端需本地缓冲与批量上报；服务端必须区分客户端时间戳与接收时间，下游按事件时间排序以处理时间回填。</li>\n<li>H3 相对 geohash 的优势是邻域距离一致性（六边形邻居等距）；中等规模可用 Redis <code>GEOSEARCH</code>（底层 52 位 geohash），规模更大再自建 H3 索引。</li>\n<li>位置表主键用 <code>(identity_id, recorded_at)</code> 使重试幂等；<code>speed_mps</code> 与 <code>heading_deg</code> 让 ETA 免于从稀疏点做差分估计。</li>\n<li>ETA 必须基于路网距离（OSRM 的 <code>route</code>/<code>table</code>/<code>match</code>）而非直线距离，并以分位数（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>75</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{75}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）而非均值对外展示；停靠时间是住宅区不可忽略的组成部分。</li>\n<li>ETA 误差需按市场/时段/类型分段监控 MAPE；轨迹数据受隐私约束，下线后必须真正停止采集。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"司机 App 轨迹与 ETA","id":"司机-app-轨迹与-eta"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：轨迹采集的三个约束","id":"核心概念-轨迹采集的三个约束"},{"level":3,"text":"精度、频率与电量的三方博弈","id":"精度-频率与电量的三方博弈"},{"level":3,"text":"断网与弱网","id":"断网与弱网"},{"level":2,"text":"从坐标到格子：地理索引的选择","id":"从坐标到格子-地理索引的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"H3 与 geohash 的取舍","id":"h3-与-geohash-的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"位置写入的幂等与去重","id":"位置写入的幂等与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"ETA 估计：从直线距离到可信时间","id":"eta-估计-从直线距离到可信时间"},{"level":3,"text":"朴素估计及其失效场景","id":"朴素估计及其失效场景"},{"level":3,"text":"分位数的 ETA 而非期望值","id":"分位数的-eta-而非期望值"},{"level":3,"text":"误差监控","id":"误差监控"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私边界","id":"隐私边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"峰谷弹性运力补充","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/elastic-capacity-schedule/peak-valley-crowd-supplement"},"next":{"title":"众包与传统承运商混合编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/elastic-capacity-schedule/hybrid-carrier-crowd-mix"}}